      "id": 263039,
      "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
      "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-04-18T19:55:44.435Z",
      "cooked": "<p>FWIW, there’s a read-through and critique of the adventure (and all the other ones) on this thread:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads%2Ffrivyeti-reads-sentinel-comics-adventures.913386%2Fpage-4\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d139fe10b8c9b1d74080a66c448c206fc4f28801.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"A6769D\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads%2Ffrivyeti-reads-sentinel-comics-adventures.913386%2Fpage-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPGnet Forums</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads%2Ffrivyeti-reads-sentinel-comics-adventures.913386%2Fpage-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📖 Let's Read! - FrivYeti Reads Sentinel Comics Adventures! | Tabletop...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Starter Set Comparisons, Pt. 2: Up The Water Spout\n\nOkay, let’s see how things have changed in the first issue, “Itsy-Bitsy Spiders!” \n\nFirst off, just to get it out of the way - all of the formatting boxes have been updated to the new style guide. I...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Might be helpful if you want a preview, but there are spoilers if you’re not going to be running things yourself.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-04-18T19:55:44.435Z",
